<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HOS" style="id" />
  <para style="h">KOCEA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk pa Kocea</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kocea</para>
  <para style="toc3">Koc</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">KOCEA</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Lanebi Kocea otito lok pa Lubanga ki i tung kumalo me lobo Icrael, inge lanebi Amoc, ikare ma onongo piny rac ma onongo peya kimayo lobo Camaria i mwaka miya abiro ki pyere aryo wiye acel, ma onongo peya kinywalo Rwot Yecu Kricito. En onongo oparo tutwal kit ma jo Icrael guloke gudok kaworo cal jogi mapol ata ma ka woro Lubanga ki me bedo lugen bote. Me weko ada me tim man onen kamaleng, Kocea onyutu man kun wok ki ikom tim pa dakone ma en onyomo ma pe lagen ma cabe atata kibedo ki co mapol ata ma en timo tim kwelekwele kwedgi. Kit macalo dakone Gomer a cito woko ki co mukeneni, i kit yo acelu bene jo pa Lubanga gia woko ki bot Lubanga ci gicito woko kaworo lubangagu mukene ducu. Piman, kibiketo pwod ikom jo Icrael bene. Kadi bed kumeno, i agikine mar pa Lubanga ma pe gik ikom jo mereni binyute makato, ma weko en bidwoko jone cen bote ka dong kibiroco wat matye ikin gi. Mar man kinyutu ilok magi: “Atwero jalowu ningning ka, wun jo Icrael? Atwero bwotowu woko kenwu ningning ka? Cwinya pida miyo pe atwero! Mar mera pirwu tye madit dok tek adada” 11:8</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Nyom pa Kocea ki kwo ma i ode <char style="ior"><ref loc="HOS 1:1-3:5">1:1—3:5</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lok me juk ma kitito ikom Icrael <char style="ior"><ref loc="HOS 4:1-13:16">4:1—13:16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lok ma kitito me ningut ki me cike <char style="ior"><ref loc="HOS 14:1-9">14:1-9</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HOS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 14:23-15:7">2 Luk 14:23—15:7</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 15:32-16:20">15:32—16:20</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:1-20:21">18:1—20:21</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 26:1-27:8">2 Tek 26:1—27:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 28:1-32:33">28:1—32:33</ref></char>
    </note>Man lok pa Rwot mayam owaco bot Kocea, wod pa Beeri ikare pa Ujia, Yocam, Akaj ki Kejekia ma gin luker me Juda, ki ikare pa Jeroboam wod pa Yoaci rwot me Icrael.<verse eid="HOS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dako ki lutino pa Kocea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 1:2" />Ikare ma Rwot okwongo lok ki i dog Kocea, Rwot owaco bot Kocea ni, “Cit wek inyom nyako ma lakwele, wek inywal kwede lutino me kwele, wek inyut ki jona kit ma gin pe lugen ikoma pien gitye katimo tim kwele pi kwero lubu Rwot.” <verse eid="HOS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 1:3" />Ci Kocea ocito onyomo Gomer nya pa Diblaim, ci Gomer ogamo ic, ci onywalo latin laco.<verse eid="HOS 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 1:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 10:11">2 Luk 10:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ci Rwot owaco bot Kocea ni, “Cak nyinge Jejreel, pien odong kare manok, ci abiketo mere pwod ikom ot pa Yeko pi remo ma en oonyo i Jejreel, dok abimiyo ker me ot pa Icrael dong gik woko. <verse eid="HOS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 1:5" />Dok inino meno abituru teko pa mony me Icrael woko ki i nota me Jejreel.”<verse eid="HOS 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 1:6" />Gomer dok ogamo ic, ci onywalo latin nyako, ci Rwot owaco bot Kocea ni, “Cak nyinge Lo-rukama,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="fk">Lo-rukama </char> te loke ni pe kitime kica nyo Akwero. </note> pien pe dok abimede ki timo kica ikom ot pa Icrael pi balgi kadi ki acel, dok pe bene abinyutu botgi mar mera. <verse eid="HOS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 1:7" />Ento abitimo kica ki ot pa Juda, abilarogi pi tek pa Rwot Lubangagi; ento pe abilarogi ki atum, kadi ki pala lucwan, nyo ki lweny, nyo ki aguragura, kadi ki wegi aguragura.”<verse eid="HOS 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 1:8" />Ka dong Gomer ogengo latin cak, ci ogamo ic, onywalo latin laco. <verse eid="HOS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 1:9" />Ci Rwot owaco ni, “Cak nyinge, Lo-ammi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="fk">Lo-ammi </char> i leb Ibru te loke ni pe jona onyo Kal Okwera. </note> pien jo Icrael pe gubedo jona, dok an bene pe Lubangagi.”<verse eid="HOS 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kibiroco Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 1:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 9:26">Rom 9:26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ento wel jo Icrael bibedo macalo kweyo me dog nam, ma pe pime, dok ma pe kwane bene; dok i kabedo kama yam kiwaco botgi ni, “Wun pe wujona,” kibiwaco botgi ni, “Wun lutino pa Lubanga makwo.” <verse eid="HOS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 1:11" />Jo Juda ki jo Icrael gibicoke kacel, ci gibiketo ngat acel ma bitelo wigi; ci gibia woko ki i lobo meno, pien nino pa Jejreel bibedo dit tutwal.<verse eid="HOS 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HOS 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 2:1" />Pimeno, wuwac bot ominwu ni, “Ammi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="fk">Ammi </char> teloke: Jona nyo Lakal. </note>” ki bot laminwu ni, “Rukama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="fk">Rukama </char> te loke kitime kica nyo Lamaro. </note>.”<verse eid="HOS 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gomer pe lagen, jo Icrael pe lugen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 2:2" />Wun lutinona, wupid ki minwu, wupide, kadi bed en pe dong dakona, ki an bene pe dong a cware. Wubak dogwu bote wek okwany ki i kwone tim kwele ki abor woko ki ikin tunune. <verse eid="HOS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 2:3" />Ka pe kumeno, ci abiwalo kome dong munero kit ma kinywale kwede; abiloke doko calo tim aroo, abimiye bedo calo lobo ma otwo, abineke woko ki orwo pii. <verse eid="HOS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 2:4" />Pe abitimo lutinone kica, pien gin lutino me kwele. <verse eid="HOS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 2:5" />Pien min gi obedo lakwele, pien oyac pi timo tim me lewic. Pien owaco ni, “Abilubu kor coga, ma gimiya gin acama ki pii ma akwo kwede, dok bene gimiya yer romo, pamba, moo Jeituni ki kongo bwino.” <verse eid="HOS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 2:6" />Pimeno abicelo yoone woko ki okutu, abigero cel arume kwede woko wek pe onong yoo wote. <verse eid="HOS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 2:7" />En biryemo kor coge, ento pe bimakogi i wangayo; en biyenyogi, ento pe binongo komgi. Lacen en biwaco ni, “Abiloke, adok bot cwara mukwongo ca, pien onongo abedo maber makato ma kombedi.”<verse eid="HOS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 2:8" />En yam pe ongeyo ni an aye ma amiye ngano, ki kongo bwino ki moo Jeituni, pe oniang ni an aye amiyo ryal onya bote, ki jabu ma gitiyo kwede bot jok Baal. <verse eid="HOS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 2:9" />Pimeno ka kare biromo, ci abitwone nganona, ki kongo bwinona, ci bene abikwanyo yer romona ki pambana, ma onongo oumu kikome matye muneroni. <verse eid="HOS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 2:10" />Koni dong abilunyu bongine woko ki ikome ci bidong munero inyim coge, ci ngat mo pe bilare ki i cinga. <verse eid="HOS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 2:11" />Abimiyo yomcwinye gik woko. Ninone madito, Por Dwe, ki Cabite, ki nino madito ducu mayam aciko pirgi. <verse eid="HOS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 2:12" />Abibalo oloke ki odurune, ma en loko ikomgi ni magi aye mot ma coge gumiye. Abilokogi gidoko bunga, ci lee tim bicamogi woko. <verse eid="HOS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 2:13" />Abiketo can ikome pi nino madito pa Baal, ma en wango iye odok eceta botgi, kun ruke maber ki agit ki tiko ngut me welgu, ka en lubu kwede kor coge, kun wiye wil woko ikoma, man lok pa Rwot kikome.<verse eid="HOS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mar pa Rwot ikom jone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 2:14" />Pimeno nen, abibite mot, ci abitere woko wa i tim, kun aywayo tame ki lok mamit. <verse eid="HOS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 2:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:24-26">Yoc 7:24-26</ref></char></note>Abimiye poto oloke ki kunu, abiloko Nota me Ayelayela doko dogola me gen. Ci en bidoka iye ki kunu kit mayam en oloko kwede ka tinone, marom ki lok ma oloko ma onongo a ki i lobo Ejipt. <verse eid="HOS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 2:16" />Inino meno, en bilwonga iye ni, “Cwara,” ci en pe dok bidok cen bot Baal. <verse eid="HOS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 2:17" />Pien abikwanyo nying Baal woko ki i doge matwal, pe dok kibilwongo nyingi.<verse eid="HOS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HOS 2:18" />Dok inino meno abiketo gicike pirwu kun acike ki lee tim, kacel ki winyo me polo, ki gin ma lak alaka i ngom; dok abijuku atum, ki pala lucwan, kacel ki mony iwi lobo, wek amii wubut piny ki kuc.<verse eid="HOS 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HOS 2:19" />Ci abikwanyi in Icrael, abinyomi ibedo mera matwal;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:19">abinyomi anyuti kit atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:19">ki lengcwiny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:19">ki mar ma pe loke, kacel ki kica.<verse eid="HOS 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HOS 2:20" />Abinyomi ki gen ma pe loke ci dong idoko mera dok abigwoko cikena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:20">ci dok ibingeya ni an a Rwot.<verse eid="HOS 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HOS 2:21" />Inino meno abigamo lega pa jona jo Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:21">“Abiciko polo me cwalo kot i lobo;<verse eid="HOS 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HOS 2:22" />ci lobo biceko ngano, kongo bwino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:22">ki moo Jeituni, i nota me Jejreel.<verse eid="HOS 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HOS 2:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 9:25">Rom 9:25</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:10">1 Pet 2:10</ref></char>
    </note>An kikoma aye abicoyo kodine piny i lobo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:23">Abitimo kica bot Lo-rukama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="fk">Lo-rukama </char> te loke ni an pe amarowu. </note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:23">ci abiwaco bot Lo-ammi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="fk">Lo-ammi </char> te loke ni wun pe jona. </note> ni, ‘Wun jona,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 2:23">ci gin biwaco ni, ‘In Lubangawa.’”<verse eid="HOS 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HOS 3" />
  <para style="s1">Kocea ki dako ma latim abor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 3:1" />Rwot owaca ni, “Dok icit imar dako ma latim abor matye ki meye ma en mare kwede; macalo an Rwot amaro jo Icrael, kadi bed guloke gudok kaworo lubangagu kun gimaro tyero poki olok ma otwo bot jogi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ikare ca onongo jo mogo gityero pok oloki bot lubangagu me nyodo, ma onongo dano yam gitye ki niye ni lubanga magi gitwero miyo jo ma worogi giceko cam mabup. </char></note>”<verse eid="HOS 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 3:2" />Ka dong awile pi cekel apar wiye abic me ryal, ki cayiri maromo kilo miya acel ki pyere abic. <verse eid="HOS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 3:3" />Ci awace ni, “Myero ibed dakona, kun pe ibedo lakwele, dok pe bene ibut ki laco mo; kadi bed bitero kare malac ma an pe abibutu kwedi.” <verse eid="HOS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 3:4" />Pien jo Icrael birii pi kare malac labongo rwotgi mo nyo laker mo, labongo gitum nyo wir me aworagi, labongo cal lubanga mo ma myero gupeny doge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leb Ibru waco ni labongo epod nyo terapim. </char></note> <verse eid="HOS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 3:5" />Lacen jo Icrael dok biloke, gibicako yenyo Rwot Lubangagi, ki lakwar Daudi acel mo ma bibedo rwotgi; pimeno ber pa Rwot bimiyo gidwogo bote ki lworo ikare matye anyim kun gilimo mot mere.<verse eid="HOS 3:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HOS 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kop ma Rwot okelo ikom Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 4:1" />Wuwiny lok pa Rwot, wun jo Icrael; pien Rwot tye ki kop ikom jo mabedo i lobo man; pien ada peke, mar peke, ki ngec mo ikom Lubanga bene peke i lobowu. <verse eid="HOS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 4:2" />Gin matye en aye kwong me goba, nek, kwalo kwo ki timo abor. <verse eid="HOS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 4:3" />Pimeno lobo tye kakumu, jo ducu ma gibedo iye gitye kadoko goro, ki lee tim bene, kacel ki winyo me polo; wa rec me nam bene bito woko.<verse eid="HOS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kop ma Rwot okelo ikom Ajwaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 4:4" />Rwot waco ni, “Ngat mo pe okel lok me da, dano mo pe odot lawote pien an atye ki kop ikom wun ajwaki aye. <verse eid="HOS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 4:5" />Kop ma angolo ikomwu en aye ni, wun kacel ki lunebi wubitwome dyeceng jwi, kit ma dano twome kwede dyewor, dok abityeko meni Icrael woko. <verse eid="HOS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 4:6" />Jona gitye ka to pi ngecgi manok. Pien wun wukwero pwonya ki bene bedo ki ngec, omiyo akwerowu ni pe wubed ajwakina. Wun wukwero lubu cik pa an Lubangawu woko, omiyo an bene abikwero ni lutinowu pe gubed ajwakina.<verse eid="HOS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 4:7" />Ka welwu omede mapol, ci wun bene wumede ki timo bal ikoma; man dong bimiyo abiloko deyowu doko me lewic. <verse eid="HOS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 4:8" />Wuloko bal pa jona odoko gin ma keliwu lonyo, omiyo wun wumito ni jona gumede kun gitimo bal. <verse eid="HOS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 4:9" />Abimiyowu pwod marom aroma ki pwod pa dano ata; ci abipwodowu pi kitwu, dok abiculuwu ma oporo timwu bene. <verse eid="HOS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 4:10" />Wubicam, ento pe wubiyeng; wubitimo tim kwele pi woro jok nywalgu, ento pe wubinya dok pe wubinongo nyodo; pien wuweko an Rwot Lubangawu woko kun wuloke dong kaworo lubanga mukenegu.”<verse eid="HOS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rwot ojuku jone pe me woro jogi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 4:11" />Rwot waco kuman ni, “Kongo bwino makec ki kongo bwino malibone ki tim kwele tye karwenyo tam wi dano woko. <verse eid="HOS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 4:12" />Jona gicito kapenyo dog kac, odoogi aye ma nyutu botgi lok. Pien cwinygi me kwele onongo pyete omiyo gungak kaworo cal jogi calo dako ma malaya pi timo tim kwele, ma omiyo gungak woko kaworo lubangagu, omiyo guweko woro an Lubangagi kikome woko. <verse eid="HOS 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 4:13" />Gitumu gitumgi malo iwi godi, giwango gitumgi iwi cere malo, ite kworo, atega ki olwedo, pien ni te tipugi ber.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HOS 4:13">Pimeno omiyo anyirawu gitimo tim kwele, ki anyira gerwu bene gitimo abor. <verse eid="HOS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 4:14" />Pe abiketo can ikom anyirawu ka gitimo tim kwele, kadi wa ikom anyira gerwu ka gitimo abor; pien co kikomgi bene gitye kanywako kit yo acelu ki lukwele, dok gitumu gitumgu kacel ki malaya me ot jogi. Kit ma carolok tito ni, ‘Rok ma pe giniang piny gibito woko.’<verse eid="HOS 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 4:15" />Kadi bed wun jo Icrael, wuloke woko ki ikoma kun wudok i tim kwele me woro jogi, ci pe Juda odok labal acelu. In Juda, pe ilub kor jo ma gicito i Gilgal onyo i Bet-aven<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="fk">Bet-aven </char> tere ni, “Ot bal,” kitiyo ki nying mukene ni Betel, ma tere ni, “Ot pa Lubanga.”</note> kaworo cal jogi. Gin gibwole ken gi kunu ka gikwongo ki nyinga ni, ‘Macalo Rwot tye ma kwo ni.’ <verse eid="HOS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 4:16" />Icrael bene lapele, calo roya ma lapele. An kono dok abitwero pitowu ningning macalo lakwat ma kwayo lutino romi i olet malac wek gucam? <verse eid="HOS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 4:17" />Woro cal jogi dong omiyo jo Icrael gubange woko, wek dong gucit i yogi ken gi gire. <verse eid="HOS 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HOS 4:18" />Gin lwak ma lumero, komgi mit katimo tim me kwele; gimaro lewic makato deyogi. <verse eid="HOS 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HOS 4:19" />Kibiterogi woko cen macalo gin ma yamo tero, ci lewic bimakogi pi gityergi bot lubanga atagu.”<verse eid="HOS 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HOS 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 5:1" />Rwot waco kuman ni, “Wuwiny lok man, wun ajwaki pa Lubanga, wuket cwinywu, wun ot pa Icrael. Wucik itwu, wun ot pa rwot. Pien kop ma kingolo otiko komwu; pien wun wubedo owic i Mijpa, ki obwo ma kiciko iwi got Tabor. <verse eid="HOS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 5:2" />Wun wubedo calo bur ma kikwinyo matut i Citim,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="fk">Citim </char> i leb Ibru, ngat mo pe mangeyo teloke, ento kitamoni twero bedo kabedo ma kilwongo ni taun madit me kacia. </note> ento abiketo can ikomwu ducu. <verse eid="HOS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 5:3" />Angeyo anga ma in ibedo, Icrael in pe itwero kane ki bota. Wun jo Icrael kombedi wudoko lutim kwele, dok bene dong wubale woko gire ma pe wupore me woro an.”<verse eid="HOS 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kocea ojuku lwak pi woro cal jogi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 5:4" />Tim maracu ma gimaroni gengogi woko me dwogo bot Lubanga; pien cwinygi dong tye me woro lubanga mukenegu, omiyo pe dong gitwero ngeyo Rwot. <verse eid="HOS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 5:5" />Wake pa Icrael odoko caden matye inyima; Epraim bitwome pi bale; kadi Juda bene binywako twome kwedgi. <verse eid="HOS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 5:6" />Gibiwot ki romi ki dyangigi me gitum pi yenyo Rwot, ento pe gibinonge; pien Rwot dong otyeko a woko ki botgi. <verse eid="HOS 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 5:7" />Gin gubwota woko, dok lutinogi bene gubedo lurok ata ki bota. Pimeno pe dong gibikwero Karamagi me Por Dwe pien dong abityekogi woko kacel ki camgi ducu matye i potigi.<verse eid="HOS 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mony ikin Juda ki Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 5:8" />Wukut bila me oto mony i Gibea, wukut gwara me oto lweny i Rama. Wugo oduru me mony i Bet-aven<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="fk">Bet-aven </char> teloke ni “Ot me tim maracu”; Kitye katic ki nying man ma ka Betel, ma teloke ni “Ot pa Lubanga.”</note>; wun jo pa Benjamin wurwayo cok i dog lweny! <verse eid="HOS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 5:9" />Icrael bidoko obur inino ma kibiketo can ikome. Anyutu lok me ada ma bitime ikin kaka ma i Icrael ducu.<verse eid="HOS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 5:10" />Rwot waco kuman ni, “Luker me Juda gubedo calo jo ma gikobo got ma poko wang lobo; guoto mony ikom lobo Icrael ci gumayo ngomgi woko, dong abicoro kinigana ikomgi macalo pii. <verse eid="HOS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 5:11" />Ngolo kop ma abiketo ikom Epraim dong bidiyo en matek dok ture woko, Icrael orwenyo ngom ma meggi ma en onongo tye kitwero iye. Pien en otyeko miine kalubu kor gin ma konye peke. <verse eid="HOS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 5:12" />Pieno abidoko calo nyenye ma nango kom Epraim, dok abityeko teko pa Juda woko calo tut ma camo wir ot ci tyeko tekone woko.<verse eid="HOS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 5:13" />Ikare ma Icrael oneno kit ma twone lit kwede, ki kit ma Juda bene oneno wang bure, omiyo Icrael owoto wa i Aciria, ci ocwalo kwena bot rwot madit. Ento en pe otwero cangowu, kadi wa bur mewu bene pe otwero cangone. <verse eid="HOS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 5:14" />Pieno abibedo macalo labwor bot Icrael, dok abibedo macalo latin labwor ikom ot pa Juda. An, an kikoma aye abikilo komwu woko, ka dong abiwoto gira; ikare ma abiywayowu aterowu cen, ngat ma bilarowu bibedo peke.<verse eid="HOS 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 5:15" />Abidok gira i kabedona, nio wang ma guniang ikom balgi ci dong gicako yenyo an, gibiyenya ikare ma gitye i can, ka can dong ogudu komgi ci gibidwogo bota.”<verse eid="HOS 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HOS 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ngut me goba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 6:1" />Jo Icrael giwaco ni, “Wubin wek wadok wunu cen bot Rwot; pien en okilo komwa woko; wek en aye ocangwa; en otyeko pwodowa matek, dok bitweyo wang retwa. <verse eid="HOS 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 6:2" />Ka nino okato aryo, en bicerowa woko, inino me adeke bimiyowa kwo, wek dok wabed ma komwa yot inyime. <verse eid="HOS 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 6:3" />Weku dong wangeyu Rwot, wacuku cwinywa kangeyo en; en bidwogo ada macalo rupiny; en bibino botwa macalo kot omaa moyo, calo kot me cwir ma bido lobo.”<verse eid="HOS 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 6:4" />Ento Rwot waco kuman ni, “In Icrael abitimi ningning? Abitimi ningning in Juda? Mar mewu rom ki pol ma umu piny odiko, dok bene rom ki toyo ma two woko oyot. <verse eid="HOS 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 6:5" />En ma omiyo acwalo lunebi botwu ki kwena me ngolo kop ki me tyekowu woko. Dong gin ma an amito ki botwu tye atyer kamaleng: <verse eid="HOS 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 6:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:13">Mat 9:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:7">12:7</ref></char></note>An cwinya mito mar ma pe loke, pe amito lee me gitum. Ngeyo Lubanga ber; kato gitum awanga ma wutyero botani.<verse eid="HOS 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 6:7" />Ento gin gukalo wi gicikena i Adam, ci gutiyo gin ma pe atir ikoma ki kunu. <verse eid="HOS 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 6:8" />Gilead aye taun pa lutim aranyi, ma opong ki lunek. <verse eid="HOS 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 6:9" />Macalo luyak gikiyo dano, ajwaki bene gicoke kacel kumeno; gineko dano i yoo ma cito i Cekem, kun gitimo gin marac tutwal. <verse eid="HOS 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 6:10" />Aneno gin mo marac ma okato kare woko i Ot pa Lubanga pa Icrael. Tim kwele pa Icrael tye i lobo kunu, ki jona bene dong gubale woko pi woro cal jogi.<verse eid="HOS 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 6:11" />In Juda bene dong atyeko yubu kare me pwodwu woko. Kadi bed ni amito mada me dwoko gum pa jona wek gubed maber i lobogi.<verse eid="HOS 6:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HOS 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 7:1" />Ikare ducu ma amito dwoko gum bot jona, ki ikare ma amito cango iye Icrael, ci balgi otugi nen woko cut, ki tim maracu ma jo Camaria gutimo; pien gitimo bwami, lakwo turu ot, kun luyak giyako dano ki i gudu. <verse eid="HOS 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 7:2" />Ento gin pe giparo ni an apo ikom gin maracu ducu ma gitiyoni. Koni timgi dong orumugi woko dyere, dong timgi tye inyima.”<verse eid="HOS 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yub me roro i gang ker pa rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 7:3" />Rwot waco kuman ni, “Dano giyomo cwiny rwot ki timgi maracuni, kun bene giyomo cwiny lukergi ki bwolagi. <verse eid="HOS 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 7:4" />Gin ducu lutim abor; girom ki keno malyeto lodimac otwak iye, ki ma lated mugati pe dok cwako iye mac, nia ikare ma en orubu iye tobi ki moko nio ka oyenyo, ma mugatine dong ocako kwot. <verse eid="HOS 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 7:5" />Inino me karama pa rwotwa ma en oyubu, luloce ducu gucako mero ki kongo bwino ma gumatoni; ci rwot ocako ribe kacel kwedgi i timgi me mingomingo. <verse eid="HOS 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 7:6" />Pien cwinygi obedo kalyeti pi lok ma gubedo kapiro ikom rwotgi. Kinigagi okur calo mac dyewor benebene, ci ki odiko ocako lyel calo mac arum ikom rwotgi.<verse eid="HOS 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 7:7" />Gin ducu gudoko lyet macalo keno, guneko lulocgi woko ducu. Lukergi ducu guto woko, pe tye ngat mo ikin gi ma kok bota pi kony.”<verse eid="HOS 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Icrael ki Rok mukene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 7:8" />Rwot waco kuman ni, “Jo Icrael gurube woko ikin lurok; gubedo calo mugati capat ma pe ocek maber. <verse eid="HOS 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 7:9" />Gin bene gipeke ki ngec ni ribe ki rok mukeneni dong otyeko tekogi woko; ninogi dong odong manok mo keken, ento gin pe gingeyo. <verse eid="HOS 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 7:10" />Wake pa Icrael odoko caden ikome; ento pe gudwogo bot an Rwot Lubangagi, kadi bed gineno can, ento pe guyenyo an ma Lubangagini. <verse eid="HOS 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 7:11" />Icrael ming rom ki amam ma wiye bene pe tiyo; gikok mere bot Ejipt, dok gicito mere wa i Aciria kayenyo kony. <verse eid="HOS 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 7:12" />Ento abiciko obwona i yo ma gicito iye ducu, ci abiretogi woko piny macalo winyo ma tuk malo, abipwodogi pi timgi maracuni.<verse eid="HOS 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 7:13" />Gibineno can, pien gungak guweka woko! Ci kibityekogi woko, pien gujemo ikoma! Onongo amito larogi, ento giloko lok goba ikoma. <verse eid="HOS 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 7:14" />Pe gikok bota ki cwinygi ducu, ento gibedo kacur acura ki iwi kitandagi; gingolo komgi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="fk">Gingolo komgi </char> “Ngolo kom” onongo obedo yo acel me woro jok Baal. </note> keken gi ki pala kun gibako doggi bot lubanga pa lurok pi ngano ki kongo bwino, kun nongo gijemo kwede ikoma. <verse eid="HOS 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 7:15" />Kadi bed yam apwonyogi kun amiyo gudoko jo matek, ento gin pud gidok kayubu lok marac ikoma. <verse eid="HOS 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 7:16" />Giloke gidok bot jok Baal; girom ki atum ma ogom ma pe kitwero bayone cito atir. Rwodigi bito ki pala lucwan, pi ngala ma i doggi. Man bimiyo kicayogi wa i lobo Ejipt.”<verse eid="HOS 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HOS 8" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot ojuku jo Icrael pi woro cal jogi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 8:1" />Rwot waco kuman ni, “Wukut tum! Pien lumerok gitye kabino macalo acut kamonyo lobona; jona dong guturu gicikena, dok bene gukalo wi cika woko. <verse eid="HOS 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 8:2" />Kadi bed jo Icrael gikok bota kun giwaco ni, ‘In Lubangawa, wan wangeyi,’ <verse eid="HOS 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 8:3" />ento gin dong gubolo gin maber woko, omiyo lumerok dong biryemo korgi.<verse eid="HOS 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 8:4" />Jona guketo lukergi labongo twerona, guketo lulocgi labongo ngeca. Gutiyo cal jogigi ki ryal ki jabugi; gin gigi gutiyo gin ma neko gin kikomgi. <verse eid="HOS 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 8:5" />Akemo omaka ikomwu pi cal latin twon ma wuworoni, wun jo Camaria. Kinigana otede ikomwu calo mac. Jo Icrael bitero kare marom mene ka, ka dong gibibwoto woro cal jogi? <verse eid="HOS 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 8:6" />Latin twon ma wuworo i Camaria, ladiro tic aye ma otiyo ki cinge! Pe obedo Lubanga kikome! Pimeno kibingidone woko matinotino! <verse eid="HOS 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 8:7" />Pien gin me mingo ma Icrael gitiyo obedo calo coyo yamo, ento gin ma gibikayo ki iye bibedo calo lapiru. Ngano ma i poto ma pe ongok, moko mo bene pe bia iye. Ento kadi ka mogo ocek, ci lurok aye biyako woko ducu. <verse eid="HOS 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 8:8" />Icrael dong odoko calo rok ata mogo; gin dong gudoko calo agulu ma oto, ma konye peke liweng. <verse eid="HOS 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 8:9" />Icrael obedo calo kana me tim ma woto kene kun yenyo twon; en ocito wa i Aciria kayenyo kony dok bene oculu lim bot rok mukene wek gugwoke. <verse eid="HOS 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 8:10" />Kadi bed gucate ken gi ikin lurok, ento abidwokogi woko oyotoyot. Ci gibineno can malit ite loc pa rwot madit me Aciria.<verse eid="HOS 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 8:11" />Jo Icrael gunyayo lwak keno tyer mapol pi tiyo iye lakwany balgi, ento keno tyergi mapoli odoko kama gitiyo iye bal mapol ata. <verse eid="HOS 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 8:12" />Kadi kono acoo cika mapol ata botgi, ento gin pud gikwerogi woko macalo gin ma welo ki botgi. <verse eid="HOS 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 8:13" />Gimaro gitum; gin gitumu lee pi camo ringone; ento cwinya pe yom ikomgi. Ikare man abipo pi timgi maracuni, ci abiketo can ikomgi pi bal meggi; dong gibidok cen wa i Ejipt.<verse eid="HOS 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 8:14" />Pien Icrael wiye dong owil woko ikom ngat ma ocweyo en, ci ocako gero gangkal madongo; Juda ogero taun madito mapol ma kirumugi ki cel gogo; ento abicwalo mac ikom taun gi madito, ci biwangogi woko ducu.”<verse eid="HOS 8:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HOS 9" />
  <para style="s1">Kocea otito pi pwod ma kibiketo ikom Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 9:1" />Wun jo Icrael, pe wubed ki yomcwiny kakwero karamawu macalo rok mukene gikwero, pien wun wuweko Lubangawu ci wudoko jo ma pe lugen ikabedo ducu. Ilaro moyo ducu, wun wucate woko bot Baal macalo lakwele cate kun wumaro timo kwele pi nongo ngano ma wutamoni Baal aye omiyo me culuwu. <verse eid="HOS 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 9:2" />Ento kare dong cok romo ma wubibedo ki ngano ki moo Jeituni manok mo, dok bene kongo bwino bibedo peke. <verse eid="HOS 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 9:3" />Pe wubibedo i lobo pa Rwot ento wubidok cen i Ejipt, dok wubicamo cam ma cik ogengogi i lobo Aciria. <verse eid="HOS 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 9:4" />Pe wubiliyo kongo bwino me gitum amata bot Rwot, pe wubiyomo cwinye ki gitum mewu. Mugatiwu bibedo calo mugati pa jo ma kwero cola; jo ducu ma gucamo gidoko keni, calo kwon ma kicamo iwi lyel. Pien kwonwu bibedo me lanek kec keken, pe myero kikel wa i Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="HOS 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 9:5" />Wubitimo gin ango inino madito me karama, ki inino madito me woro Rwot? <verse eid="HOS 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 9:6" />Ka man otime manongo dong guket woko ata wa i lobo Aciria, ci jo Ejipt aye bicokogi kacel kayikogi i Mempic. Jamigi ducu me ryal ma yomo cwinygi kacel ki odigi, doo ki okutu aye bimayogi woko.<verse eid="HOS 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 9:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 21:22">Luk 21:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kare me pwodo Icrael dong oo, kare me culu adwogi me bal dong oromo; Icrael bingeyone maber atika. Pi bal mewu madwong ki adagadaga madwong omiyo wuwaco ni, “Lanebi en aye dano ma lapoya, ki dano matye ki Cwiny pa Lubanga ni odoko laming!” <verse eid="HOS 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 9:8" />Lubanga ooro an lanebi macalo lakurpiny pa Icrael, ma gin jone, ento wun wuciko owic pa ladwar i wangayona ducu ma acito iye, dok wupongo i Ot pa Lubanga bene ki adagadaga ikom lanebine. <verse eid="HOS 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 9:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 19:1-30">Lung 19:1-30</ref></char></note>Gin gudonyo i bal matut tutwal, macalo ikare me Gibea. Lubanga bipo pi tim meggi maracuni, dok biketo can ikomgi pi balgi.<verse eid="HOS 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bal ma Icrael otiyo ki adwogine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 9:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 25:1-5">Wel 25:1-5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rwot owaco ni, “Ikare mayam anongo Icrael, onongo obedo calo nongo nyig olok ma i tim. Ikare mayam aneno kwariwu, onongo obedo calo neno nyig oduru ma pud ocako cek aceka ikarene. Ento ka yam ceng guo i Baal-peor, ci gucako miine ken gi bot cal jogi, omiyo gudoko gin ma cwiny Lubanga dag marom ki jogi ma gin giworo dok gimaroni. <verse eid="HOS 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 9:11" />Deyo pa Icrael biket woko ata, macalo winyo ma tware, nywal bibedo peke botgi, wa gamo ic bibedo peke ki dongo ic bene bibedo peke. <verse eid="HOS 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 9:12" />Dok kadi bed gupit lutinogi, ci abityekogi woko ducu, mo pe bidong. Ikare ma abia woko ki botgi, gin bineno can madit tutwal!<verse eid="HOS 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 9:13" />Aketo wanga ci aneno kit ma Icrael munya macalo otit ma odongo i lobo ma ceko cam mabup maber mada. Ento kombedi dong Icrael bicwalo lutinone woko me aneka macalo lee tim. <verse eid="HOS 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 9:14" />Ai Rwot, gin ango ma abilego ni i tim pi joni Icrael ka? Mii bot mon gi poto ic, dok wek tunugi bene obed ma otwo libeng.”<verse eid="HOS 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngolo kop ikom Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 9:15" />Rwot waco kit man ni, “Racgi ducu ocake ki i Gilgal, kama yam cwinya ocako kwerogi iye. Pi gin maracu ma gubedo katimone, abiryemogi woko ki i oda. Pe dok abimarogi matwal; rwodigi ducu gubedo jo ma lujemo. <verse eid="HOS 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 9:16" />Icrael rom ki yat ma dong kireto woko piny, ma lwite oner woko, pe dong binyako nyige. Dok kadi bed ginywal, ento abineko lutinogi ma gimaroni woko.”<verse eid="HOS 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lanebi oloko lok man ikom Icarel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 9:17" />Lubangana ma atiyo bote bikwero jone, bibayogi woko, pien gukwero winyo loke; gibibedo lumalgang ikin rok ducu.<verse eid="HOS 9:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HOS 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 10:1" />Icrael onongo obedo calo olok ma nyige onyak ma mwonya, ci ocek mabup. Ka nyige omede ki nyak madwong, ci en bene omede ki cano keno tyer mapol; ka lonyo me lobone omede odoko madwong, ci en bene omedo ki yubu wir jogi me aworane mabeco. <verse eid="HOS 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 10:2" />Cwinygi opong ki lok me mingo; kombedi myero dong gunen can pi balgi. Rwot kikome aye bimuku keno tyergi woko, dok en bene bitongo wir jogigi woko ducu ma gucibo me aworagi.<verse eid="HOS 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 10:3" />Koni dong gibipenye ni, “Pe watye ki rwot pien wan dong onongo pe walworo Rwot Lubanga, dok kadi bed onongo watye ki rwot, en kono onongo twero timowa kit gin ango?” <verse eid="HOS 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 10:4" />Giloko lok doggi nono, gimoko gicike ki kwong me goba; kumeno gimiyo tim maracu twi dongo macalo yat matye ki kwir ma neko dano ma dong olot i poto ma kipuru.<verse eid="HOS 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 10:5" />Jo ma gibedo i Camaria komgi bimyel, pi latin twon jabu me Bet-aven. Jo mere ducu gibikwero colane, ajwakine ma giworo cal jok gibikok pire, pi deyone ma dong oa woko ki bote. <verse eid="HOS 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 10:6" />Cal twon meno kikome aye kibitero woko wa i Aciria, macalo mot ma kitero bot rwot madit. Kibimiyo lewic mako Icrael, dok bene lewic bimake pi cal jogine. <verse eid="HOS 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 10:7" />Rwot me Camaria pe binen, kibitero woko macalo yat ma ongide ma kwang iwi pii. <verse eid="HOS 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 10:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:30">Luk 23:30</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:16">Niy 6:16</ref></char></note>Kabedo madito me woro Lubanga matye iwi got me Aven, en aye kama Icrael tiyo iye bal, kibijwero woko. Okutu ki ocok gibitwi iwi keno tyergi, ci gibiwaco ki godi madongo ni, “Umwa woko!” Ki bot godi matino bene ni, “Wupot ikomwa!”<verse eid="HOS 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot otito pi ngolo kop ikom Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 10:9" />Rwot waco kuman ni, <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 19:1-30">Lung 19:1-30</ref></char></note>“In Icrael ibedo katimo bal nia wa ikare me Gibea; nia wa ikare ca wubedo kamede ameda. Pimeno mony bipoto ikomwu i Gibea. <verse eid="HOS 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 10:10" />An abibino kapwodo jo ma ojemo; lurok bene bicoke kacel ikomgi ikare ma abipwodogi pi balgi aryonu.<verse eid="HOS 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 10:11" />Icrael yam calo roya ma kipwonyo, ma maro tic me dino ngano. Ento aketo rii kweri ingute maberi wek otii tic matek me ywayo kweri dyang me pur. Aweko Juda bene oywayo kweri dyang dok Icrael bene onudu poto. <verse eid="HOS 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 10:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:3">Jer 4:3</ref></char></note>Wucer poto bot woko, wucoo kodi me kit ma atir, wek wuka nyig me mar ma pe loke, pien man aye kare me yenyo Rwot, wek en obin omii lar mere ocwer ikomwu macalo kot. <verse eid="HOS 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 10:13" />Yam wupuru bal, ci wukayo kit ma pe atir, omiyo wucamo nyig gobawu. Pien wubedo kageno gadigadi lwenywu, ki lwak twoni otekawu, <verse eid="HOS 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 10:14" />pimeno oduru me lweny biwo ikin jowu, odiwu ma kirumu ki cel gogo kibimuku woko liweng, macalo Calman yam omuku Betarbel ikare me mony, megi lutino yam kinyotogi woko kacel ki lutinogi. <verse eid="HOS 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 10:15" />Meno en kit ma kibitimowu kwede, wun ot pa Icrael, pi balwu madit tutwali. Ka lweny bicake kwarpiny, ci kibineko rwot me Icrael woko cut.”<verse eid="HOS 10:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HOS 11" />
  <para style="s1">Mar pa Lubanga ikom jone ma lujemoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 4:22">Nia 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 2:15">Mat 2:15</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:1">“Ikare ma Icrael pud latin, onongo amare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:1">yam alwongo woda nia ki i Ejipt.<verse eid="HOS 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 11:2" />Ento kayam amede ki lwongogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:2">ci gin bene gumede ki a woko ki bota;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:2">gubedo gigi katumu gitum bot jok Baal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:2">kun bene giwango odok eceta bot cal jogi.<verse eid="HOS 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 11:3" />Kun kono an aye ceng apwonyo jo Icrael ki wot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:3">yam atingogi ikora;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:3">ento pe gungeyo ni an aye acangogi.<verse eid="HOS 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 11:4" />Yam abedo katelogi ki tol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:4">ki twon mar madwong ma atweyogi kwede.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:4">Dok abedo katingogi macalo latin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:4">ma abolo iwi gwoka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:4">kun akule botgi piny kapitogi.<verse eid="HOS 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 11:5" />Gibidok woko wa i lobo Ejipt, ci Aciria aye bibedo rwotgi, pien gukwero dwogo bota. <verse eid="HOS 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 11:6" />Pala lucwan bilweny ikom taun gi madito ducu, bitongo rii dogola me dog celgi woko, dok bene binekogi woko ki i cel gogogi. <verse eid="HOS 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 11:7" />Jo mera dong gumoko tamgi me a woko ki bota; pimeno gibikok bot En Mamalo Twal pi okol ma kiketo ingutgi, ento pe tye dano mo ma bigonyogi.<verse eid="HOS 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 11:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 29:23">Nwo 29:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Atwero weki woko ningning ka, in Icrael?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:8">Atwero miyi bot ngat mukene ningning, in Icrael?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:8">Atwero miyo idoko calo Adma ningning?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:8">Abitimo in macalo Jeboim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="fk">Jeboim </char> ki Adma obedo taun aryo ma Rwot otyekogi bene ikare ma en otyeko Sodom ki Gomorra (nen i Nwoyo Cik 29:23). </note> ningning ka?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:8">Cwinya dong odwogo woko ikomi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:8">iya dong okwe woko ikomi pi maro in.<verse eid="HOS 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 11:9" />Pe dong abitic ki kiniga malyet ikomi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:9">dok pe abineko jo Icrael atyekogi woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:9">pien an Lubanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:9">pe a dano, an a Ngat Maleng ikinwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 11:9">pe abibino botwu ki kiniga pi tyekowu woko.<verse eid="HOS 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 11:10" />Jona gibilubu kora ikare ma abimor macalo labwor ikom lukworgi; eyo, gin gibibino kun gia ki tung kupotoceng ma komgi myel. <verse eid="HOS 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 11:11" />Gin bia ki i Ejipt gibino oyotoyot calo winyo, dok gibia ki i Aciria macalo amam, ci abidwokogi wa i pacigi, man lok pa an Rwot kikome.”<verse eid="HOS 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingolokop oloyo Icrael ki Juda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 11:12" />Rwot waco ni, “Jo Icrael dong gugura woko dyere ki gobagi kun gibedo mere kaloko bwola keken, ki jo Juda bene gitye kajemo ajema ikoma, an Lubanga ma gene dok Ngat Maleng me Icrael.<verse eid="HOS 11:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HOS 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 12:1" />Gin ducu ma lutela pa jo Icrael gitiyo cake wa odiko nio kwede wa i otyeno obedo gin ma konygi peke liweng. Gin gimede ameda ki ticgi me nyayo goba ki tim bwami keken; giketo gicike ki jo Aciria, dok gitero moo jeituni wa i Ejipt pi yenyo kony ki botgi. <verse eid="HOS 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 12:2" />Rwot tye ki kop ikom Juda, en biketo can ikom Yakobo ma oporo kite, dok bene bicule marom ki tim ma mere. <verse eid="HOS 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 12:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:26">Aca 25:26</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:24-26">Aca 32:24-26</ref></char></note>Kare ma kwarogi Yakobo onongo tye i ic, en omako opuny tyen omine obedo kalweny ki omine Ecau, ka dong oteggi, olwenyo ki Lubanga. <verse eid="HOS 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 12:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:10-22">Aca 28:10-22</ref></char></note>Olwenyo ki lamalaika, ci oloyo, obako doge bot lamalaika ki pig wange. Dok orwate ki Lubanga i Betel, ci Lubanga oloko kwede kikunu. <verse eid="HOS 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 12:5" />En Rwot Lubanga me mony, ma nyinge Rwot. <verse eid="HOS 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 12:6" />Pimeno in dong idwog cen bot Lubangani wek okonyi. Mok ikom mar ki tiyo gin matye atir, kun ikuru Lubangani kare ducu.”<verse eid="HOS 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lok mukene pi ngolo kop</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 12:7" />Rwot waco ni, “Jo Icrael gubedo calo lucatwil ma gitye ki lapim ma pe pimo kakare, gimaro bumu dano. <verse eid="HOS 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 12:8" />Jo Icrael giwake kun giwaco ni, ‘Nen wan lulonyo, wanongo limwa giwa ki wiwa; ma ngat mo pe matwero dotowa ni wanongo lonyowa ki tim me buma.’ <verse eid="HOS 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 12:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:42-43">Lev 23:42-43</ref></char></note>Ento an a Rwot Lubangawu ma akelowu nia wa ki i lobo Ejipt; abimiyo wubibutu i kema dok aye, macalo ikare ma wutye i tim.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="fk">Macalo … i tim </char> gonyo telok man matye ileb Ibru tek. Twero bedoni lok man lube ki mwaka pyere angwen ma jo Icrael gubedo kawot i tim ca inge a ki i Ejipt, onyo bene twero bedo ni tye kalok ikom bolo ma jo Icrael onongo gibedo iye ikare me kwero Karama me Bolo (nen 9:5,6). </note> <verse eid="HOS 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 12:10" />Yam aloko bot lunebi, an aye ma amiyo ginanyuta onya odoko madwong, dok amiyo carolok kati ki bot lunebi. <verse eid="HOS 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 12:11" />Giworo cal twoni i Gilead, pimeno jo ducu ma worogi gibitum woko ducu liweng; gityero twoni me gitum i Gilgal, keno tyergi bene bidoko calo gweng ma odure ma kiguro i poto ma kipuru. <verse eid="HOS 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 12:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:1-20">Aca 29:1-20</ref></char></note>Yakobo yam oringo ocito wa i lobo Aram, Icrael con otiyo tic kunu pi nyomo dako, en yam okwayo romi wek enong dako. <verse eid="HOS 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 12:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:50-51">Nia 12:50-51</ref></char></note>Rwot yam ocwalo lanebi me laro Yakobo woko ki i Ejipt, dok omiyo lanebi ogwoke. <verse eid="HOS 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 12:14" />Jo Icrael dong gungeto cwiny Rwot matek omiyo kiniga omake; man omiyo kibingolo to iwigi gire pi balgi ducu. Rwotgi bipwodogi pi cac ducu ma gukelo ikome.”<verse eid="HOS 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HOS 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ngolo kop me agiki ikom jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 13:1" />Epraim ka yam oloko, onongo kom kaka ducu ma i lobo Icrael myel; Epraim yam dit matek i Icrael; ento en okelo bal ikome pi woro jok Baal, ci en koni dong bito woko pi bale. <verse eid="HOS 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 13:2" />Kombedi balgi dong tye kamede ameda, gitye katiyo gigi cal ryal ma giliyo pirgi ken gi, kun gitiyo lwak cal jogi ki diro; magi ducu weng obedo tic pa ludiro. Gin guwaco ni, “Wutum gitum bot jogi magi.” Gin ango ma myero owek dano gunot lem latin twon dyang! <verse eid="HOS 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 13:3" />Pimeno gibibedo calo lupuu ma poto odiko, calo toyo ma o woko oyotoyot, calo cung kal ma yamo kolo woko ki i laro, onyo yito ma duny ki i wang dirica.<verse eid="HOS 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 13:4" />Ento Rwot waco kuman ni, “An a Rwot Lubangani, an aye yam atelowu woko nia wa ki i lobo Ejipt; pe tye Lubanga mukene ma ingeyo, kono an keken, lalar mo mukene pe tye, kono an keken. <verse eid="HOS 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 13:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:11-17">Nwo 8:11-17</ref></char></note>An aye yam agwokowu i tim aroo, i lobo ma can pii dwong iye. <verse eid="HOS 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 13:6" />Ento ikare ma wucamo wuyeng, ka wuyeng, ci cwinywu ocako pong ki waka matek; omiyo wiwu owil woko ikoma. <verse eid="HOS 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 13:7" />Pimeno dong abiloke botwu adoko macalo labwor, ci dok abibedo kakiyowu inget yoo macalo kwac. <verse eid="HOS 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 13:8" />Abipoto ikomwu macalo nguu mager ma kikwanyo lutinone woko, ci abiyeco korwu adado woko, dok abimwodowu macalo labwor; kit ma lee tim kilo ki komgi.<verse eid="HOS 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 13:9" />Wun jo Icrael, abityekowu woko; anga kono ma bikonyowu? <verse eid="HOS 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 13:10" />Yam onongo wumito ni kimii botwu rwot ki lutela do, <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:5-6">1 Cam 8:5-6</ref></char></note>ento kombedi dong rwotwu tye kwene maromo larwu? Rwodiwu ducu gitye kwene ma gin obedo lucungdwarwu? <verse eid="HOS 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 13:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:17-24">1 Cam 10:17-24</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 15:26">15:26</ref></char></note>Ceng amiyowu luker ikare me kiniga, ka dok akwanyogi woko bene ki akemona.<verse eid="HOS 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 13:12" />Bal pa Icrael maracu ducu tye kicoyo woko piny, bale dong bene kikano woko. <verse eid="HOS 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 13:13" />Icrael kimiye gum me bedo kwo, ento en latin ma pe ryek; en calo latin ma kare me nywalone dong oromo woko, ento obutu arii ci omoko woko i ic, wiye pe otike ki yoo nyodo. <verse eid="HOS 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 13:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:55">1 Kor 15:55</ref></char></note>Dong pe abilarogi ki i twer me lyel dok pe bene abikokogi woko ki i dog to. Abimiyo two gemo poto ikomgi. Abimiyo gito ci kiyikogi woko ilyel. Kica dong pe maka ikomgi. <verse eid="HOS 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 13:15" />Kadi bed en nya matek macalo lagada, yamo oro ma abicwalo bibino ki i tim, ci wang piine ma gunyeni bitwo woko ki itte bene bidwon woko; yamo bimayo jamine mabeco ducu mayam yomo cwinye, ma en onongo okanoni. <verse eid="HOS 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 13:16" />Camaria bineno can pi bale, pien en ojemo woko ikom an Lubangane. Pala lucwan aye binekogi woko, lutinogi kibijwatogi woko piny, ci kinyotogi woko, ki mon gi ma giyac kibiryeko igi woko.”<verse eid="HOS 13:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="HOS 14" />
  <para style="s1">Kocea okwayo Icrael me dok bot Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 14:1" />In Icrael, dong idwog bot Rwot Lubangani, pien dong itwomo tyeni pi bali. <verse eid="HOS 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 14:2" />Wudwog cen bot Rwot, ci wumii kwacwu me kica obed gityerwu; wuwac bote ni, “Kwany balwa woko ducu; gam motwa, ci wan wabipako in kit ma wacike kwedeni. <verse eid="HOS 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 14:3" />Aciria pe bilarowa matwal, kadiwa aguragura bene pe bigwokowa. Dong pe wabiwaco ki cal ma watiyo atiya ki cingwa ni, ‘Wun Lubangawa.’ Ai Rwot, jo ma lacungudwargi peke ginongo kica ki boti.”<verse eid="HOS 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rwot ocike me miyo kwo manyen bot jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 14:4" />Rwot waco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:4">“Abidwogo jona cen bota.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:4">Abimarogi pi bercwinya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:4">pien kinigana dong oa woko ki ikomgi.<verse eid="HOS 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 14:5" />Abibedo macalo toyo bot jo Icrael;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:5">en bituru macalo lenga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:5">ci bicwalo lwite piny macalo atega.<verse eid="HOS 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 14:6" />Gibilot, ci gijany,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:6">gibibedo ber macalo jeituni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:6">dok ngwecgi bibedo kur macalo ngwec Lebanon.<verse eid="HOS 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 14:7" />Gibidwogo ci gibibedo ite gwok ma mera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:7">gibinywal macalo kal ma i poto; gibituru calo olok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:7">ngwecgi bibedo makur macalo ngwec kongo bwino me Lebanon.<verse eid="HOS 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 14:8" />Jo Icrael pe dong gibiworo cal jogi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:8">An abigamo legagi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:8">dok an abigwokogi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:8">Macalo yat ciprec ma pote pe ner, kitmeno bene abigwokogi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HOS 14:8">an aye abimiyo gum nya botgi.”<verse eid="HOS 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ladol lok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 14:9" />Ngat maryek biniang lok magi; dano ma cwinye lwodo lok aye bingeyogi; pien yo pa Rwot ducu tye atir, jo ma cwinygi atir aye gilubu yone, ento jo ma gikalo wi cik pa Lubanga gitwomo tyen gi iye.<verse eid="HOS 14:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 14" />
</usx>